{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 6, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a Japan bound quest\nA journey grand to put thy soul to test.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Bright Domain**\n\nFrom skies afar to Narita's gate thou dost arrive\nWhere bustling streets a vibrant scene revive.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage shall be borne\nA modern marvel brightly newly sworn.\nA feast awaits a ramen's steaming grace\nTo banish weariness from thy weary face.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Grandeur and Sacred Space**\n\nTo Imperial Palace a regal sight\nWhere history whispers bathed in golden light.\nThen Meiji Shrine a peaceful verdant hold\nWhere ancient spirits stories yet unfold.\nHarajuku's fashion a whimsical display\nYouthful exuberance brightens every day.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Embrace**\n\nHakone's allure a landscape fair and bold\nWith Mount Fuji's presence a sight to behold.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi a tranquil dream\nReflecting heavens a shimmering gleam.\nArt museums beckon a cultural delight\nWhere brushstrokes dance in shades of dark and light.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm a Thousand Temples Gleam**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto swift thou'lt fly\nWhere ancient temples kiss the azure sky.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion maze\nThrough sacred pathways in a sunlit haze.\nGion's geishas a fleeting graceful art\nA whispered legend held within the heart.\n\n**Day Five: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling sheen\nA mirrored image serene and ever keen.\nRyoan-ji's garden rocks in silent pose\nWhere contemplation deep within one grows.\nNijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's pride\nWhere power once resided far and wide.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara's park where friendly deer roam free\nA gentle greeting for all eyes to see.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA monument of faith across the land.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns softly glow\